# rclone --exclude-from for cloud-mirror.sh (one filter pattern per line,
# rclone filtering syntax: a leading / anchors at the remote root, ** matches
# everything below). Override the file with CLOUD_MIRROR_EXCLUDES.
#
# Excluded paths are excluded on BOTH sides of the sync: adding a line here
# stops mirroring the path but never deletes what is already on disk — remove
# a leftover tree under $NAS_ROOT/gdrive by hand.

# this machine's own DB backups (backup-dbs.sh uploads them; already on local disk)
backups/**
# /Choir/Choir is a Drive shortcut pointing at its own parent -> infinite recursion
/Choir/Choir/**
